@startuml
title Rules Engine — создание и публикация сценария

actor "Пользователь" as User
participant "API Gateway" as APIGW
participant "Rules API" as API
participant "Rule Designer Service" as Designer
participant "Rule Validator" as Validator
participant "Version Manager" as Versioning
participant "Rule Manager" as RuleMgr
database "RuleDraftRepository" as DraftRepo
database "RuleVersionRepository" as VersionRepo
database "RuleRepository" as RuleRepo
participant "Device Registry" as DR

== Создание черновика ==
User -> APIGW: Создать / изменить сценарий
APIGW -> API: POST /rules
API -> Designer: createDraft(cmd)\nили updateDraft(cmd)
Designer -> DraftRepo: save(draft)
DraftRepo --> Designer: RuleDraft
Designer --> API: RuleDraft
API --> APIGW: draft_id
APIGW --> User: Черновик сохранён

== Публикация сценария ==
User -> APIGW: Опубликовать сценарий
APIGW -> API: POST /rules/{draft_id}/publish

API -> Versioning: publishDraft(draft_id)
Versioning -> DraftRepo: findById(draft_id)
DraftRepo --> Versioning: RuleDraft

Versioning -> Validator: validateDraft(draft)
Validator -> DR: проверить устройство,\nдопустимость действия и цели
DR --> Validator: OK

Validator --> Versioning: ValidationResult(OK)

Versioning -> VersionRepo: save(RuleVersion)\nstatus=Published
VersionRepo --> Versioning: RuleVersion

Versioning -> RuleMgr: registerRule(version)
RuleMgr -> RuleRepo: save(Rule)\nstatus=Active,\ncurrentVersion=version
RuleRepo --> RuleMgr: Rule

RuleMgr --> Versioning: Rule(active)
Versioning --> API: RuleVersion + Rule
API --> APIGW: 200 OK
APIGW --> User: Сценарий опубликован и активирован

@enduml